{"step_index":41,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-11-18T05:03:21Z","content":"Created At: 2026-11-18T13:03:21+08:00\nCompleted At: 2026-11-18T13:03:21+08:00\n{\"messages\":[{\"seq\":6,\"agent\":\"tidy\",\"text\":\"Steps 1–3 done. Moved pipeline/v5_organize.py to archive/scripts/v5/. README.md: removed it from the pipeline row, LATEST row now lists 3 blends (incl. clay), and added v5_clay/render_clay/mux_clay/v5_preview. docs/README_V5.md: 25→26 机位 (title, §1, §5, §7), §7 paths changed to LATEST/, plus clay scripts, v5_viewport_fast, v4_stage_rig and the clay mp4; the clay steps are in 复现. docs/README_V4.md pointer: 25→26. Editing-guide draft is ready (needs Empty names and counts). FYI @env: the header docstrings of v5_env.py:5 and v5_anim.py:4-5 still say pipeline/v5_stage_*.blend, but the code writes to LATEST/. Fix it while you're in there. Waiting for env's final summary before steps 4–5.\",\"time\":\"2026-11-18 12:55:26\",\"request_id\":\"2555de4c-d513-4b45-aaae-c927de159518\"},{\"seq\":7,\"agent\":\"env\",\"text\":\"@verifier Rebuild ready for check (env → anim → clay all rebuilt 13:02).\\nFiles: pipeline/v5_env.py, pipeline/v5_anim.py → LATEST/v5_stage_env.blend, v5_stage_anim.blend, v5_stage_anim_clay.blend. Originals backed up in C:\\\\Users\\\\86052\\\\.gemini\\\\antigravity\\\\brain\\\\f904dce7-b62b-4bab-b561-90c92d39c8a3\\\\scratch\\\\orig\\\\.\\nCounts: env 919 → 616 objects (V5_ meshes 672 → 348, +21 Empties); anim 948 → 645 (591 mesh, 26 cam, 21 empty, 5 light); clay: car 243 / env 347 meshes.\\nChanges:\\n1. Step 13: view_layer.update(); origin-to-geometry only for unparented V5_ meshes whose matrix_basis is identity (world-baked), 191 objects. Box/sphere objects keep their location. My check vs your ref_env_1114: 0 piled at origin, all 348 meshes matched by name/group, bbox-center delta ≈0 except stand Columns/Flagpoles/Flags, which have fewer parts on purpose (the 11/17 build halved them: int(L/14), int(L/40)). Every origin sits at its bbox center.\\n2. FencePosts: ±0.07 m along the tangent, 486 real quads. 3. FieldMasts: faces use base+i. 4. Brake poles: ±0.32 m along the tangent, merged per group into V5_Brake_{i}_Poles.\\n5. Per stand: _Trusses (86 beams total, front→back roof edge, 0.16 m), _Columns, _FrontPosts, _Flagpoles and _Flags (multi-material: V5_Flag_0..4) are each ONE mesh. V5_PitBoxLine_* → V5_PitBoxLines (60 quads, all faces up). 0 loose verts, 0 duplicate faces, 0 zero-area faces in V5_ meshes.\\n6. 21 Empties (ARROWS, Z-rotation = track heading, at ground center): V5_Stand_{Main,T1,Mid,Complex,South,Club}, V5_Bridge_A/B, V5_Screen_A/B, V5_Brake_0..2, V5_Marshal_0..6, V5_Gantry (posts, beam, banner, 5 start lights). Children use parent_inverse = I and matrix_basis = parent⁻¹·world, so their location reads relative to the Empty. My move test: all children follow exactly. Removed empty collections 09_Studio_Stage_Rig and WheelSpokes_FL/FR/RL/RR. Renamed objects to avoid clashing with the Empty names: Stand_X_{i}→Stand_X_Tier{i}, Screen_A→Screen_A_Panel (+_Legs), Bridge_A→Bridge_A_Deck (+_Piers, _Rails), Marshal_i→Marshal_i_Hut / _Lamp, Gantry_Post_-1/1→_L/_R.\\n7. v5_anim: removed the duplicate CAR_LEN/SENSOR_W/lens_for_framing. Physics check PASS (0 over-limit frames, 0 heading jumps, 41059 LINEAR keys). Fixed the docstring paths in both scripts.\\nExtra, render-neutral vs the 11/14 color film: asphalt/grass noise and mow stripes now use Geometry.Position (world) instead of TexCoord.Object, so re-origining no longer shifts the pattern (11/14 had origins at world 0). Flags use random.seed(11), so builds are reproducible.\\nTest stills: renders_v5/test/test_0040.jpg, test_0700.jpg, test_1500.jpg vs renders_v5/frames/f_0040/0700/1500.jpg. Same look; the only visible difference is the now-visible thin fence posts. Close-up clay checks: scratch\\\\chk_V5_Stand_Main.jpg, chk_V5_Gantry.jpg, chk_V5_Bridge_A.jpg, chk_V5_Brake_0.jpg (same scratch dir as above).\",\"time\":\"2026-11-18 13:03:16\",\"request_id\":\"f10e86a5-bab1-4440-a23d-541f0a5b03b6\"}],\"head\":7}"}
